' =============================================================================
' LeafMap Insights – Sequence диаграми (PlantUML)
' Node.js клиент, Auth API, Data API, MAUI приложение
' =============================================================================

@startuml Node.js_LeafMapInsightsNodeClient
title LeafMapInsightsNodeClient (Node.js уеб сайт, роли User/Admin)

actor User as Потребител
actor Admin as Администратор
participant Browser as "Браузър\n(app.js)"
participant Node as "Node сървър\n(Express)"
participant AuthAPI as "Auth API"
participant DataAPI as "Data API"

== Конфигурация при зареждане ==
Browser -> Node: GET /api-config
Node --> Browser: { apiBaseUrl, authApiBaseUrl }
Browser -> DataAPI: GET api/divisions (проверка на API)
DataAPI --> Browser: 200 OK / грешка

== Вход / Регистрация (User или Admin) ==
User -> Browser: Login / Register
Browser -> AuthAPI: POST api/auth/login|register { email, password, userName? }
AuthAPI --> Browser: { token, email, expiresAt, roles=[User|Admin] }
Browser -> Browser: setToken() → localStorage
Browser -> Browser: updateAuthUI() (показва линк „Админ“ ако roles съдържа Admin)

== Обикновен потребител (User) – дървета и таксономия (четене) ==
User -> Browser: Навигация (trees, tree, taxonomy, add-tree)
Browser -> DataAPI: GET api/trees, api/trees/{id}, api/divisions, ... [Bearer optional]
DataAPI --> Browser: JSON
Browser -> User: Рендира страници

== User – добавяне на дърво ==
User -> Browser: Попълва форма „Добави дърво“
Browser -> DataAPI: GET api/divisions,... (dropdown-и)
DataAPI --> Browser: списъци
Browser -> DataAPI: POST api/trees { name, latitude, ... } [Bearer User/Admin]
DataAPI --> Browser: 201 Created
Browser -> User: Успех

== Admin – управление на потребители и таксономия ==
Admin -> Browser: Отваря admin.html
Browser -> AuthAPI: GET api/users [Authorization: Bearer Admin]
AuthAPI --> Browser: [ { id, email, roles[] }, ... ]
Browser -> Admin: Показва списък потребители

Admin -> Browser: CRUD таксономия
Browser -> DataAPI: POST/PUT/DELETE api/divisions|taxonomyclasses|families|genera|species [Bearer Admin]
DataAPI --> Browser: 201/204/...

== Изход ==
User -> Browser: Изход
Browser -> Browser: removeItem(TOKEN_KEY)
@enduml

@startuml API_Authentication_Flow
title Auth API – Вход и регистрация

actor Client as Клиент\n(Static/Node/MAUI)
participant AuthAPI as "Auth API\n(LeafMap Insights Auth)"

== Вход (Login) ==
Client -> AuthAPI: POST api/auth/login\n{ "email", "password" }
AuthAPI --> Client: 200 OK\n{ token, email, expiresAt }

== Регистрация (Register) ==
Client -> AuthAPI: POST api/auth/register\n{ "email", "password", "userName"? }
AuthAPI --> Client: 200 OK\n{ token, email, expiresAt }

== Грешка (напр. невалидни данни) ==
Client -> AuthAPI: POST api/auth/login (невалидни данни)
AuthAPI --> Client: 401 / 400\n{ message, ... }
@enduml

@startuml API_Data_Flow
title Data API – Дървета и таксономия (роли User/Admin)

actor User as КлиентUser\n(Static/Node/MAUI)
actor Admin as КлиентAdmin\n(Static/Node/MAUI)
participant DataAPI as "Data API\n(ASPLeadMapInsightsAPI)"
database Db as База данни

== Проверка на връзка и публично четене ==
User -> DataAPI: GET api/divisions
DataAPI -> Db: SELECT Divisions
Db --> DataAPI: divisions
DataAPI --> User: 200 OK [ { id, name }, ... ]

== Дървета – четене (User/Admin) ==
User -> DataAPI: GET api/trees?includeLookups=true [Bearer optional]
DataAPI -> Db: SELECT Trees (+ lookups)
Db --> DataAPI: данни
DataAPI --> User: 200 OK [ TreeDto, ... ]

User -> DataAPI: GET api/trees/{id}?includeLookups=true [Bearer optional]
DataAPI -> Db: SELECT Tree by Id
Db --> DataAPI: tree
DataAPI --> User: 200 OK TreeDto

== Дървета – CRUD (всеки логнат) ==
User -> DataAPI: POST api/trees { ... } [Bearer User]
DataAPI -> DataAPI: валидира JWT
DataAPI -> Db: INSERT Tree
Db --> DataAPI: OK
DataAPI --> User: 201 Created

User -> DataAPI: PUT/DELETE api/trees/{id} [Bearer User]
DataAPI -> Db: UPDATE/DELETE Tree
Db --> DataAPI: OK
DataAPI --> User: 204 NoContent

== Таксономия – CRUD само за Admin ==
Admin -> DataAPI: POST/PUT/DELETE api/divisions|taxonomyclasses|families|genera|species [Bearer Admin]
DataAPI -> DataAPI: валидира JWT и роля Admin
DataAPI -> Db: INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE lookups
Db --> DataAPI: OK
DataAPI --> Admin: 201/204

User -> DataAPI: POST/PUT/DELETE api/divisions|... [Bearer User]
DataAPI --> User: 403 Forbidden (липсва роля Admin)

@enduml

@startuml MAUI_LeafMapInsights
title MAUILeafMapInsights (User/Admin, Admin flyout)

actor User as Потребител
actor Admin as Администратор
participant MAUI as "MAUI App"
participant AuthService as "AuthService\n(SecureStorage + Roles)"
participant LeafMapApi as "LeafMapApiService\n(HttpClient)"
participant AuthAPI as "Auth API"
participant DataAPI as "Data API"

== Начална страница (HomePage) ==
User -> MAUI: Отваря приложението
MAUI -> AuthService: GetTokenAsync()
AuthService --> MAUI: token / null
MAUI -> User: Показва \"Вход\" или \"Изход\"; AdminFlyoutItem.IsVisible според IsAdminAsync()

== Вход / Регистрация (User или Admin) ==
User -> MAUI: LoginPage / RegisterPage
MAUI -> LeafMapApi: LoginAsync / RegisterAsync
LeafMapApi -> AuthAPI: POST api/auth/login|register { email, password, userName? }
AuthAPI --> LeafMapApi: { token, email, expiresAt, roles=[User|Admin] }
LeafMapApi --> MAUI: LoginResponse
MAUI -> AuthService: SetTokenAsync(token), SetRoles(roles)
MAUI --> User: GoToAsync(\"//Trees\"), AdminFlyoutItem.IsVisible = roles съдържа Admin

== Обикновен потребител – дървета и таксономия (четене) ==
User -> MAUI: Trees / TreeDetail / Taxonomy
MAUI -> LeafMapApi: GetTreesAsync(), GetTreeAsync(id), GetDivisionsAsync(), ...
LeafMapApi -> AuthService: GetTokenAsync()
AuthService --> LeafMapApi: token (може да е null за публично четене)
LeafMapApi -> DataAPI: GET api/trees..., api/divisions... [Bearer optional]
DataAPI --> LeafMapApi: данни
LeafMapApi --> MAUI: DTO
MAUI --> User: UI

== User – добавяне на дърво ==
User -> MAUI: \"Добави дърво\"
MAUI -> AuthService: IsLoggedInAsync()
alt не е логнат
    MAUI --> User: GoToAsync(\"//Login\")
else логнат
    MAUI -> LeafMapApi: GetDivisionsAsync(), GetTaxonomyClassesAsync(), GetGeneraAsync(), GetFamiliesAsync(), GetSpeciesAsync()
    LeafMapApi -> DataAPI: GET api/divisions, api/taxonomyclasses, ... [Bearer]
    DataAPI --> LeafMapApi: списъци
    LeafMapApi --> MAUI: данни за Picker-и
    User -> MAUI: Попълва форма и Submit
    MAUI -> LeafMapApi: CreateTreeAsync(tree)
    LeafMapApi -> DataAPI: POST api/trees { name, latitude, ... } [Bearer User/Admin]
    DataAPI --> LeafMapApi: 201
    LeafMapApi --> MAUI: true
    MAUI --> User: Успех / навигация назад
end

== Admin – потребители ==
Admin -> MAUI: Избира AdminFlyoutItem → AdminPage
MAUI -> LeafMapApi: GetUsersAsync()
LeafMapApi -> AuthService: GetTokenAsync()
AuthService --> LeafMapApi: token (Admin)
LeafMapApi -> AuthAPI: GET api/users [Bearer Admin]
AuthAPI --> LeafMapApi: [ { id, email, roles[] }, ... ]
LeafMapApi --> MAUI: списък
MAUI --> Admin: Показва потребители (CRUD екраните могат да ползват същия Auth API)

@enduml

@startuml Overview_All_Clients
title Обзор – всички клиенти и API-та

participant "Static Web\n(Браузър)" as Static
participant "Node.js сайт\n(Браузър + Express)" as Node
participant "MAUI App" as MAUI
participant "Auth API" as AuthAPI
participant "Data API" as DataAPI

Static -> AuthAPI: POST api/auth/login | register
AuthAPI --> Static: token
Static -> DataAPI: GET/POST api/trees, api/divisions, ... [Bearer]

Node -> Node: GET /api-config → apiBaseUrl, authApiBaseUrl
Node -> AuthAPI: (браузър директно) login | register
AuthAPI --> Node: token
Node -> DataAPI: (браузър директно) trees, divisions, ... [Bearer]

MAUI -> AuthAPI: LoginAsync / RegisterAsync
AuthAPI --> MAUI: token → SecureStorage
MAUI -> DataAPI: GetTreesAsync, CreateTreeAsync, ... [Bearer]
DataAPI --> MAUI: DTO
@enduml
